# Power Electronics PCBA

This folder contains the hardware related to the **power conversion stage** of the system.

The power electronics are designed to operate as modular units in a **cascaded DC–AC converter topology**, enabling grid-connected operation.

---

## Contents

- `main-board/` – Main power electronics board
- `driver-boards/` – Isolated gate driver boards used to control the power switches

---

## Design Goals

- Modular and scalable architecture
- Clear separation between control and power stages
- Compatibility with different driver board implementations
- Support for experimental validation and future extensions
